    "long_instructions": "### **Predict & Trace**\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Look at the JavaScript code in `script.js`. Predict what will happen when you interact with the feature.\r\n\r\n3. Run the app and test it. Did the result match your prediction?\r\n\r\n4. Use AI Tutor to help you review the code and understand what it does.\r\n\r\n",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>My Ebook Reader</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"app\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Reading Settings</p>\n    <h1>My Ebook Reader</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"controls\" aria-label=\"Text size controls\">\n      <button id=\"smallButton\" class=\"size-button small\" type=\"button\">A</button>\n      <button id=\"mediumButton\" class=\"size-button medium active\" type=\"button\">A</button>\n      <button id=\"largeButton\" class=\"size-button large\" type=\"button\">A</button>\n      <button id=\"extraLargeButton\" class=\"size-button extra-large\" type=\"button\">A+</button>\n    </div>\n\n\n    <section class=\"reader\">\n      <h2 id=\"chapterTitle\">Chapter 1: The Hidden Door</h2>\n      <p id=\"bookText\">\n        Maya opened the old wooden door slowly. Dust drifted through the narrow\n        beam of light coming from the hallway. Inside the room, everything was\n        still except for the curtain near the window, which moved just enough to\n        make her pause. On the table sat a small wooden box with her name\n        written across the top.\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "contents": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1f2125 0%, #2d3035 100%);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 24px 16px;\n}\n\n.app {\n  max-width: 760px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.eyebrow {\n  margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #aeb4bd;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 24px 0;\n  font-size: 2.6rem;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.size-button {\n  width: 88px;\n  height: 88px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  background: #4a4d52;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);\n}\n\n.size-button:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  background: #5a5d63;\n}\n\n.size-button.active {\n  background: #1da1f2;\n}\n\n.size-button.small {\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n}\n\n.size-button.medium {\n  font-size: 2rem;\n}\n\n.size-button.large {\n  font-size: 2.5rem;\n}\n\n.size-button.extra-large {\n  font-size: 2.2rem;\n}\n\n\n.reader {\n  background: #f8f5ef;\n  color: #1f1f1f;\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  padding: 28px 24px;\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);\n}\n\n#chapterTitle {\n  margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n#bookText {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  max-width: 60ch;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  body {\n    padding: 20px 12px;\n  }\n\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 2.1rem;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .controls {\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .size-button {\n    width: 76px;\n    height: 76px;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .size-button.small {\n    font-size: 1.4rem;\n  }\n\n  .size-button.medium {\n    font-size: 1.8rem;\n  }\n\n  .size-button.large {\n    font-size: 2.2rem;\n  }\n\n  .size-button.extra-large {\n    font-size: 2rem;\n  }\n\n  .button-labels {\n    gap: 10px;\n    font-size: 0.7rem;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .button-labels span {\n    width: 76px;\n  }\n\n  .reader {\n    padding: 22px 18px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n  }\n\n  #chapterTitle {\n    font-size: 1.7rem;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n\n  #bookText {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 420px) {\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.8rem;\n  }\n\n  .eyebrow {\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n  }\n\n  .controls {\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .size-button {\n    width: 68px;\n    height: 68px;\n  }\n\n  .size-button.small {\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n  }\n\n  .size-button.medium {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n\n  .size-button.large {\n    font-size: 1.9rem;\n  }\n\n  .size-button.extra-large {\n    font-size: 1.7rem;\n  }\n\n  .button-labels {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .reader {\n    padding: 20px 16px;\n  }\n\n  #chapterTitle {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n\n  #bookText {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n  }\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "contents": "const bookText = document.getElementById(\"bookText\");\n\nconst smallButton = document.getElementById(\"smallButton\");\nconst mediumButton = document.getElementById(\"mediumButton\");\nconst largeButton = document.getElementById(\"largeButton\");\nconst extraLargeButton = document.getElementById(\"extraLargeButton\");\n\nconst defaultColor = \"#4a4d52\";\nconst selectedColor = \"#1da1f2\";\n\nconst resetButtonColor = () => {\n  smallButton.style.background = defaultColor;\n  mediumButton.style.background = defaultColor;\n  largeButton.style.background = defaultColor;\n  extraLargeButton.style.background = defaultColor;\n};\n\nconst makeButtonBlue = (buttonSize) => {\n  if (buttonSize === \"small\") {\n    smallButton.style.background = selectedColor;\n  } else if (buttonSize === \"medium\") {\n    mediumButton.style.background = selectedColor;\n  } else if (buttonSize === \"large\") {\n    largeButton.style.background = selectedColor;\n  } else if (buttonSize === \"extraLarge\") {\n    extraLargeButton.style.background = selectedColor;\n  }\n};\n\nconst changeTextSize = (size) => {\n  if (size === \"small\") {\n    bookText.style.fontSize = \"14px\";\n  } else if (size === \"medium\") {\n    bookText.style.fontSize = \"18px\";\n  } else if (size === \"large\") {\n    bookText.style.fontSize = \"22px\";\n  } else if (size === \"extraLarge\") {\n    bookText.style.fontSize = \"28px\";\n  }\n};\n\nsmallButton.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  resetButtonColor();\n  makeButtonBlue(\"small\");\n  changeTextSize(\"small\");\n});\n\nmediumButton.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  resetButtonColor();\n  makeButtonBlue(\"medium\");\n  changeTextSize(\"medium\");\n});\n\nlargeButton.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  resetButtonColor();\n  makeButtonBlue(\"large\");\n  changeTextSize(\"large\");\n});\n\nextraLargeButton.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  resetButtonColor();\n  makeButtonBlue(\"extraLarge\");\n  changeTextSize(\"extraLarge\");\n});",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "3"
      ]
    },
